  "prefLabel": "Elec 301.05 Third party electrical inspector level 1",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Elec 301.05 “Third party electrical inspector level 1” means an electrical inspector for residential units, as defined in Chapter 2 Section R202 (building) of the currently adopted International Residential Code by the state of New Hampshire, except allowing up to 4 contiguous units, shall have the minimum qualifications as required in Elec 304.05(a).\n\nSource. #12797, eff 6-6-19",
